<title>USA: Realty Income Corp raises mthly dividend.</title>
<headline>Realty Income Corp raises mthly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>ESCONDIDO, Calif. 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Realty Income Corp said on Wednesday its board of directors has authorized an increase in the monthly dividend to $0.1575 from $0.155 per share, payable December 16, to stockholders of record as of December 2.</p>
<p>The new dividend represents an annualized rate of $1.89 per share. The company cited additional revenue from its new property acquisitions as the reason for the increase. Realty Income continues its policy of declaring dividends on a monthly, not quarterly, basis.</p>
</text>
